; atc_pause.ngc - Move to safe position and pause for manual tool swap
;
; Called by flexihal_atc.c tool_change() when the requested tool is not
; in the carousel.  The machine moves to a safe position, opens the
; drawbar, and waits for the user to swap the tool and press cycle start.
;
; The user is expected to:
;   1. Remove the current tool from the spindle
;   2. Insert the new tool
;   3. Press cycle start to resume

M5    ; ensure spindle is off
M9    ; ensure coolant is off

; ── Move to safe tool change position ───────────────────────────────────────
G53 G0 Z#<_home_z>                   ; retract Z to home (safe clearance) first
G53 G0 X#<_atc_tc_x> Y#<_atc_tc_y>  ; move to tool change XY position

; ── Enter tool change mode — resumes on cycle start ─────────────────────────
$TCWAIT

; ── Measure new tool length against G59.3 toolsetter ────────────────────────
$TCMEASURE

M2
